cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research code, please cite this software repository or its archived Zenodo version."
type: software
title: "Human Casualty Occurrence and Severity in Marine Accidents in Korean Waters: Stata Analysis Code"
authors:
  - family-names: So
    given-names: Ae-Rim
repository-code: "https://github.com/soaerim/Coastal-Cargo-Casualty-Analysis"
url: "https://github.com/soaerim/Coastal-Cargo-Casualty-Analysis"
abstract: >-
  Stata analysis code for vessel-accident observations involving general cargo
  ships, tankers, tugboats, and barges in Korean waters (2014-2023). Includes
  casualty occurrence and severity models, accident-type sensitivity checks,
  parsimonious specifications, and the supplementary 11-record tugboat-barge
  classification sensitivity analysis. The underlying analysis data are not
  redistributed with the software.
keywords:
  - maritime safety
  - marine accidents
  - human casualty
  - Stata
  - logistic regression
  - partial proportional odds
